                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I personally loved this. I don't look at this as a game, more of an experience and educational trip. Once done with the initial expedition up the summit, spend some time in the Seeker section. There's more educational stuff there and audio files from experts. It's very informational. Then if you want some real scale, go to god mode and set the scale to the lowest, actual human size. It's pretty cool. I highly recommend this, especially if you are a fan of or interested in Everest.",
